The current process starts when a customer submits a request through an HSBC Branch. Depending on the requested operation, the request is processed through the available business channels, including Internet Banking (BPI) and the Contact Center (CC). These channels support several checkbook-related operations such as Activation, Protection, Unprotection, Release, Modification, and Reporting. Each request is processed manually through the corresponding channel before completion.
