The future-state business process begins when a customer submits a checkbook-related request through ChatBot Leo. The chatbot collects the required customer information and request details, then forwards the information to Power Automate for processing.

Power Automate orchestrates the business workflow and executes the requested operation, including Checkbook Activation, Protection, Unprotection, Release, Modification, and Reporting. The automation applies the required business rules, processes the request, and returns the corresponding outcome.

